{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Messages — API reference",
    "description": "Parameters and advanced features of Messages (Anthropic) for Seed models.",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Production (recommended)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Alternative URL"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/messages": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Seed Messages",
        "description": "- Call Seed using the Anthropic Messages format, including from compatible tools such as Claude Code.\n- This endpoint is stateless. Send the full history on each turn and replay assistant thinking blocks unchanged.\n- Send text, images or documents. For audio on Lite, use Chat Completions or Responses.\n- Reasoning is enabled by default. Disable it with `thinking` or adjust its depth with `output_config.effort`.\n- All models support function calls. Seed 2.1 and `doubao-seed-evolving` also support web search. (`web_search_20250305`)\n- Return structured JSON with JSON Object or JSON Schema. (`output_config.format`)\n- Repeated long prefixes are automatically billed at the cache-hit rate on a hit. No `cache_control` is needed. See `usage.cache_read_input_tokens`.\n- With `stream=true`, Anthropic SSE events arrive in order: `message_start` → `content_block_start` / `content_block_delta` / `content_block_stop` → `message_delta` → `message_stop`. The final usage appears in `message_delta`.\n- **Seed 2.0 legacy model names**: `doubao-seed-2.0-pro` / `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` are now routed to `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` and `doubao-seed-2.0-code` to `doubao-seed-evolving`; parameter behavior follows the new model. Use the new model names for new integrations. `doubao-seed-2.0-mini` is not affected\n- [Quickstart](/en/api-manual/language-series/doubao-seed-2.0/doubao-seed-2.0-messages-quickstart)",
        "operationId": "createMessageSeed",
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateMessageRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple": {
                  "summary": "Simple text chat",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Please introduce yourself"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "Using system prompt",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "system": "You are a meticulous technical editor. Answer concisely in English.",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Explain what context caching is."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "Multi-turn conversation with the full history",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Remember the passphrase RED-583."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "Got it."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What is the passphrase? Reply with only the passphrase."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "Streaming output",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "stream": true,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Write a four-line poem about autumn."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "thinking_off": {
                  "summary": "Disable reasoning",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
                    "max_tokens": 1024,
                    "thinking": {
                      "type": "disabled"
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Translate into French: Today’s meeting has been moved to 3 p.m."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "effort": {
                  "summary": "Adjust reasoning depth",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 8192,
                    "output_config": {
                      "effort": "low"
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Compare when to use quicksort and merge sort."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "vision": {
                  "summary": "Image understanding",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "image",
                            "source": {
                              "type": "url",
                              "url": "https://www.gstatic.com/webp/gallery/1.jpg"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Describe the scene and the main elements in this image."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "tool_use": {
                  "summary": "Function Call",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check today's weather in Beijing."
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "Get the weather for a specified city",
                        "input_schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "City name"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "tool_choice": {
                      "type": "auto"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "tool_result": {
                  "summary": "Return a function result",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "name": "get_weather",
                        "description": "Get the weather for a specified city",
                        "input_schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "city": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "city"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check today's weather in Beijing."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "thinking",
                            "thinking": "I need to call the weather function…",
                            "signature": "EqQBCkgIARABGAIi..."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "tool_use",
                            "id": "call_01",
                            "name": "get_weather",
                            "input": {
                              "city": "Beijing"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "tool_result",
                            "tool_use_id": "call_01",
                            "content": "Sunny, 12–22 °C, light northerly wind (Beaufort 2)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "web_search": {
                  "summary": "Web search (Seed 2.1 and Evolving only)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What were the major tech stories this past week?"
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "web_search_20250305",
                        "name": "web_search",
                        "max_uses": 2
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "structured_output": {
                  "summary": "Structured output (JSON Schema)",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
                    "max_tokens": 4096,
                    "output_config": {
                      "format": {
                        "type": "json_schema",
                        "schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "title": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "tags": {
                              "type": "array",
                              "items": {
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "title",
                            "tags"
                          ],
                          "additionalProperties": false
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Generate a title and three tags for an article about context caching."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response. Streaming requests return an Anthropic SSE event stream.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                }
              },
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The event sequence typically includes message_start, content_block_*, message_delta, and message_stop."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request parameters",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized, invalid or expired token",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Insufficient quota, recharge required",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "Insufficient quota",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "https://evolink.ai/dashboard/credits"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Access denied",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "Access denied for this model",
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "param": "model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Resource not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "Specified model not found",
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "param": "model",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limit exceeded",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 60 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "internal_server_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try again later"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The model service is temporarily unavailable.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "Upstream AI service unavailable",
                    "type": "upstream_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try different model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Service temporarily unavailable",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "Service temporarily unavailable",
                    "type": "service_unavailable_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 30 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "CreateMessageRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "max_tokens",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Choose a model\n\n| Model ID | Use case | Context window |\n|---|---|---|\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-pro` | Recommended flagship for complex reasoning, long documents and codebases | 1,000,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo` | Low-cost option for chat, extraction and agent tasks | 256,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | Lowest-priced Seed 2.1 model. Audio input is available only via Chat Completions and Responses | 1,000,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-evolving` | Updated weekly for evaluating new capabilities | 1,000,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-pro` | Legacy model name, now routed to `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 1,000,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` | Legacy model name, now routed to `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | 1,000,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-mini` | Fastest Seed 2.0 model for simple tasks | 256,000 tokens |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-code` | Legacy model name, now routed to `doubao-seed-evolving` | 1,000,000 tokens |\n\nSeed 2.1 model IDs use a hyphen (`2-1`). Seed 2.0 IDs use a period (`2.0`).",
            "enum": [
              "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-lite",
              "doubao-seed-evolving",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-lite",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-mini",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-code"
            ],
            "default": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "example": 4096,
            "description": "Maximum output tokens, including reasoning and the answer. With reasoning enabled, allow at least 1024 tokens. If the budget runs out, `stop_reason` is `max_tokens` and the response may contain only reasoning."
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "description": "Send the full message history on each turn. Preserve assistant thinking blocks and their signatures exactly.",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Message"
            }
          },
          "system": {
            "description": "System prompt as a string or an array of text blocks.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "stream": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "Stream the response as Anthropic SSE events."
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Enable or disable reasoning.",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "enabled",
                  "disabled"
                ],
                "description": "With `enabled`, the model reasons before answering (default for all Seed models). With `disabled`, it answers directly. Reasoning tokens count as output and are billed at the output rate."
              }
            }
          },
          "output_config": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Reasoning effort and structured output settings.",
            "properties": {
              "effort": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "none",
                  "minimal",
                  "low",
                  "medium",
                  "high",
                  "xhigh",
                  "max"
                ],
                "description": "Reasoning effort: `minimal` answers directly, `low` prioritizes speed, `medium` balances speed and depth, and `high` analyzes complex problems in depth.\n\nSeed 2.1 and `doubao-seed-evolving` default to `high`. Seed 2.0 defaults to `medium`. The alias `none` maps to `minimal`, and `xhigh` and `max` map to `high`."
              },
              "format": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "Structured output format",
                "required": [
                  "type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "json_object",
                      "json_schema"
                    ],
                    "description": "`json_object` returns a JSON object. Explicitly request JSON in the prompt. `json_schema` returns JSON conforming to `schema`."
                  },
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "description": "JSON Schema definition, required for `json_schema`."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "description": "Sampling temperature in [0, 2]. Adjust either `temperature` or `top_p`."
          },
          "top_p": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "description": "Nucleus sampling probability threshold in [0, 1]."
          },
          "stop_sequences": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "maxItems": 4,
            "description": "Up to four sequences that stop generation. The matched string is omitted. Disable reasoning before using this parameter."
          },
          "tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "All Seed models support functions defined with `name`, `description` and `input_schema`. For web search, use `type=web_search_20250305` and `name=web_search` on Seed 2.1 or `doubao-seed-evolving`. Seed 2.0 returns 400 for web search. Other server tools such as `web_fetch` also return 400. Each search performed is billed at the model’s rate.",
            "items": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Tool"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebSearchTool"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "tool_choice": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolChoice"
          }
        }
      },
      "Message": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "user",
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "Message role. Use the top-level `system` field for the system prompt."
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "Message content as a plain string or an array of content blocks.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContentBlock"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "ContentBlock": {
        "description": "Text, image, document, reasoning, function call or function result. Web search calls and results can also be sent back in later turns.",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ThinkingBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolUseBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolResultBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServerToolUseBlock"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebSearchResultBlock"
          }
        ]
      },
      "TextBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Text",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text"
            ],
            "description": "Always `text`."
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Text content"
          }
        }
      },
      "ImageBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Image",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "source"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image"
            ],
            "description": "Always `image`."
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "description": "Image source",
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "url",
                  "base64"
                ],
                "description": "`url`: public image URL. `base64`: Base64-encoded image data."
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Image URL, required for `url`."
              },
              "media_type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "image/jpeg",
                  "image/png",
                  "image/gif",
                  "image/webp"
                ],
                "description": "Image MIME type, required for `base64`."
              },
              "data": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Base64 image data without a `data:` prefix, required for `base64`."
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "DocumentBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Document",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "source"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "document"
            ],
            "description": "Always `document`."
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "description": "Document source",
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "url",
                  "base64",
                  "text"
                ],
                "description": "`url`: public document URL. `base64`: Base64-encoded document. `text`: plain text."
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Document URL, required for `url`."
              },
              "media_type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Document MIME type, such as `application/pdf` or `text/plain`."
              },
              "data": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Document data, required for `base64` or `text`."
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ThinkingBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Reasoning",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "thinking"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "thinking"
            ],
            "description": "Always `thinking`."
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Model reasoning. In later turns, send it back unchanged with its signature."
          },
          "signature": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Reasoning signature. In later turns, preserve the signature, reasoning and block order."
          }
        }
      },
      "ToolUseBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Tool use",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "id",
          "name",
          "input"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "tool_use"
            ],
            "description": "Always `tool_use`."
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tool call ID. Link the result using `tool_use_id`."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Function the model requested."
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "description": "Function arguments generated by the model, as an object."
          }
        }
      },
      "ToolResultBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Function result",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "tool_use_id",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "tool_result"
            ],
            "description": "Always `tool_result`."
          },
          "tool_use_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ID of the corresponding `tool_use` block."
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "Function result as a string or an array of text and image blocks.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ImageBlock"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "is_error": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "Whether the function failed."
          }
        }
      },
      "ServerToolUseBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Web search call",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "server_tool_use"
            ],
            "description": "Always `server_tool_use`."
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Server tool call ID."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tool name. For web search use `web_search`."
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "description": "Search parameters generated by the model, such as `query`."
          }
        }
      },
      "WebSearchResultBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Web search results",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "web_search_tool_result"
            ],
            "description": "Always `web_search_tool_result`."
          },
          "tool_use_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Corresponding `server_tool_use` ID."
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "Search results, or an error object with `type=web_search_tool_result_error` and an `error_code` if the search fails.",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "type": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "web_search_result"
                      ]
                    },
                    "title": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Result title"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Result URL"
                    },
                    "page_age": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Page age"
                    },
                    "encrypted_content": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Encrypted content. Return it unchanged in later turns."
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "web_search_tool_result_error"
                    ]
                  },
                  "error_code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Error code"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "Tool": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Custom function",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "input_schema"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Function name"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Description that helps the model decide when to call the function."
          },
          "input_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "description": "Function arguments defined using JSON Schema."
          }
        }
      },
      "WebSearchTool": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Web search (Seed 2.1 and Evolving only)",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "name"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "web_search_20250305"
            ],
            "description": "Always `web_search_20250305`."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "web_search"
            ],
            "description": "Always `web_search`."
          },
          "max_uses": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "Maximum searches permitted in this request."
          },
          "allowed_domains": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Search only these domains."
          },
          "blocked_domains": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Exclude these domains from search."
          },
          "user_location": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "description": "Location for the search, such as country, region or city."
          }
        }
      },
      "ToolChoice": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "description": "Tool selection policy. Configure `tools` first.",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "any",
              "tool",
              "none"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "description": "`auto`: model decides. `any`: use at least one tool. `tool`: use the tool specified by `name`. `none`: disable tool calls."
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tool name to call when `type` is `tool`."
          },
          "disable_parallel_tool_use": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "Prevent parallel tool calls in the same turn."
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier for the response",
            "example": "0217952345678901234567890abcdef"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "message"
            ],
            "description": "Always `message`."
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "Always `assistant`."
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Model used for this request.",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Generated content blocks. With reasoning enabled, a `thinking` block usually precedes the `text` block. Read all blocks with `type=\"text\"` to obtain the answer.",
            "items": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextBlock"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ThinkingBlock"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolUseBlock"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServerToolUseBlock"
                },
                {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WebSearchResultBlock"
                }
              ]
            },
            "example": [
              {
                "type": "thinking",
                "thinking": "The user wants a brief introduction…",
                "signature": "EqQBCkgIARABGAIi..."
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hello! I’m a Seed language model. I can help with reasoning, writing and coding."
              }
            ]
          },
          "stop_reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Reason generation stopped.\n\n- `end_turn`: normal completion\n- `max_tokens`: token limit reached\n- `stop_sequence`: stop sequence matched\n- `tool_use`: the model requested a function call",
            "enum": [
              "end_turn",
              "max_tokens",
              "stop_sequence",
              "tool_use"
            ],
            "example": "end_turn"
          },
          "stop_sequence": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Matched stop sequence, or `null` if none matched."
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageUsage"
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Token usage statistics",
        "properties": {
          "input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Uncached input tokens, excluding `cache_read_input_tokens`.",
            "example": 25
          },
          "cache_read_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Input tokens billed at the cache-hit rate. Total input = `input_tokens` + `cache_read_input_tokens`.",
            "example": 0
          },
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Always 0. This endpoint has no separate cache-write fee.",
            "example": 0
          },
          "output_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Output tokens, including reasoning.",
            "example": 120
          },
          "server_tool_use": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Actual server tool calls, returned when web search is used.",
            "properties": {
              "web_search_requests": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "Number of searches performed for this request. Each search is billable.",
                "example": 1
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "HTTP status error code"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Error message"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Error type"
              },
              "param": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Related parameter name"
              },
              "fallback_suggestion": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Suggestion for handling the error"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "## All APIs require Bearer Token authentication ##\n\n**Get API Key:**\n\nVisit [API Key Management Page](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) to get your API Key\n\n**Add to request header:**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "description": "Anthropic Messages-compatible API"
    }
  ]
}
